# {{PROJECT}} validation

How to run and check each repo's code, in one `## <repo>` section per repo. Agents read a repo's
section with `second-brain validation "{{PROJECT}}" <repo>` before they build or review a change.
`second-brain validation new "{{PROJECT}}" <repo>` adds a missing section.
